					<h2><a href="index.html%3Fp=413" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Shanti Sharma">Shanti Sharma</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Jan 31st, 2009 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
